# 新一轮修改 @run；按 A、B、C、D 逐组执行，每组完成后再继续。
# 异步查询按 id 查当前任务，重复查询直到 DONE / DEAD。
# 不要直接 Run All，避免后续故障配置影响前面仍在重试的任务。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8086
@run = manual-001

### A1. 接收端先失败一次，再丢一次 ACK
POST {{base}}/demo/faults?failNext=1&loseAckNext=1

### A2. 记录支付事实和通知任务
POST {{base}}/api/notify/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "notify-{{run}}-retry",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### A3. 等待 retry 任务 DONE / ACK，attempts >= 3
GET {{base}}/api/notify/tasks

### A4. 查询持久化回执 ACK
GET {{base}}/api/notify/receipts/notify-{{run}}-retry

### A5. 重复通知应返回原 ACK
POST {{base}}/api/notify/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "notify-{{run}}-retry",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### B1. 本地提交前失败，预期 409
POST {{base}}/api/notify/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "notify-{{run}}-local-fail",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "AFTER_ORDER"
}

### B2. local-fail 不应有订单
GET {{base}}/api/notify/state

### B3. local-fail 不应有通知任务
GET {{base}}/api/notify/tasks

### B4. local-fail 无回执，NOT_FOUND
GET {{base}}/api/notify/receipts/notify-{{run}}-local-fail

### C1. 让后续通知一直无法送达
POST {{base}}/demo/faults?failNext=100

### C2. 创建待验证的通知
POST {{base}}/api/notify/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "notify-{{run}}-dead-before",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### C3. 等待 dead-before 任务进入 DEAD
GET {{base}}/api/notify/tasks

### C4. 对账：接收端未处理，回执 NOT_FOUND
GET {{base}}/api/notify/receipts/notify-{{run}}-dead-before

### C5. 接收端恢复，清零故障
POST {{base}}/demo/faults

### C6. 使用原事件编号重放
POST {{base}}/api/notify/tasks/notify-{{run}}-dead-before/replay

### C7. 等待 dead-before 任务 DONE / ACK
GET {{base}}/api/notify/tasks

### C8. 最终回执 ACK
GET {{base}}/api/notify/receipts/notify-{{run}}-dead-before

### D1. 接收端正常提交，但每次都丢失 ACK
POST {{base}}/demo/faults?loseAckNext=100

### D2. 创建待验证的通知
POST {{base}}/api/notify/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "notify-{{run}}-dead-ack",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### D3. 等待 dead-ack 任务进入 DEAD
GET {{base}}/api/notify/tasks

### D4. 对账：接收端已处理，回执 ACK
GET {{base}}/api/notify/receipts/notify-{{run}}-dead-ack

### D5. 清零故障
POST {{base}}/demo/faults

### D6. 原事件编号重放，只确认原 ACK
POST {{base}}/api/notify/tasks/notify-{{run}}-dead-ack/replay

### D7. 等待 dead-ack 任务 DONE / ACK
GET {{base}}/api/notify/tasks

### D8. 回执仍为 ACK，SQL count(*) 仍为 1
GET {{base}}/api/notify/receipts/notify-{{run}}-dead-ack

### D9. 最终支付订单状态均为 PAID，无 local-fail 订单
GET {{base}}/api/notify/state

### 收尾：清零故障，便于下次验证
POST {{base}}/demo/faults
